== Description ==

'''Log Wall''' is a building material in ''[[Human Host]]'', crafted at the [[Carpentry Workbench]]. It appears as an ingredient in 5 downstream recipes at the [[Carpentry Workbench]], including [[Plank Wall]], [[Sloped Plank Roof]], [[Plank Roof]], [[Sloped Plank]], among others. See the ''Used in'' table for the full consumer list.

